  "createdAt": "2025-05-08T08:38:33Z",
  "description": "The Anker Advantage: Join the 55 million+ powered by our leading technology. Transfer Files in Seconds: Insert your M.2 NVMe/SATA SSD and connect to a USB-C or Thunderbolt 3 port to transfer files at speeds of up to 10 Gbps. Wide Compatibility: Compatible with NVMe and SATA protocols, SSDs with M or B&M keys, and size 2230 / 2242 / 2260 / 2280 SSDs. Not compatible with mSATA or PCIe AHCI SSDs. Compact and Portable: The slimline design features a lightweight aluminum casing for superior portability. What You Get: PowerExpand M.2 SSD Enclosure, USB-C to USB-A/USB-C cable, screwdriver, 2 screws, travel pouch, welcome guide, 18-month warranty, and friendly customer service.",
  "descriptionHtml": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Anker Advantage: Join the 55 million+ powered by our leading technology.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Transfer Files in Seconds: Insert your M.2 NVMe/SATA SSD and connect to a USB-C or Thunderbolt 3 port to transfer files at speeds of up to 10 Gbps.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Wide Compatibility: Compatible with NVMe and SATA protocols, SSDs with M or B&amp;M keys, and size 2230 / 2242 / 2260 / 2280 SSDs. Not compatible with mSATA or PCIe AHCI SSDs.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Compact and Portable: The slimline design features a lightweight aluminum casing for superior portability.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">What You Get: PowerExpand M.2 SSD Enclosure, USB-C to USB-A/USB-C cable, screwdriver, 2 screws, travel pouch, welcome guide, 18-month warranty, and friendly customer service.</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "encodedVariantAvailability": "v1_",
